## Login

**Route:** `POST /api/auth/login`

### Request body

```json
{
  "identifier": "<email or phone>",
  "password": "<password>"
}
```

### Response `data` (success)

`ResponseData.successWithCode(httpCode, data)` — body includes:

```json
{
  "status": 200,
  "message": "",
  "error": [],
  "data": {
    "account": { "customer": { "customerId": 1, ... }, ... },
    "token": {
      "accessToken": "<jwt>",
      "refreshToken": "<jwt>"
    }
  }
}
```

Use **`data.token.accessToken`** as Bearer token. Customer id: **`data.account.customer.customerId`**.

## Get ICE servers (WebRTC)

**Route:** `GET /api/video-call/ice-config`  
**Controller:** `VideoCallController.getIceConfig`  
**Auth:** none

### Response 200

```json
{
  "status": 200,
  "message": "",
  "error": [],
  "data": {
    "iceServers": [
      { "urls": "stun:..." },
      { "urls": "turn:...", "username": "...", "credential": "..." }
    ]
  }
}
```

STUN/TURN entries depend on env (`STUN_SERVER_URLS`, `TURN_*`).
